  "content": "<h2>🔔 现已支持 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/respackopts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Respackopts</a>！</h2><p>只想要草方块？不想改变仙人掌？对甘蔗没兴趣？没问题。<br>\nRespackopts 为资源包添加了在资源包菜单中显示配置界面的功能。<br>\n只需开关你想要的或不需要的特性即可！</p><h1>运作方式</h1><p>此资源包仅会添加自定义<strong>模型</strong>和<strong>方块状态</strong>，<em>不包含任何纹理</em>。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/512/667/2022-11-04_22.png\" alt=\"默认展示\"></p><p>它利用现有纹理，微妙地改变了部分环境<strong>方块模型</strong>（例如草和仙人掌）。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1464/816/194d76cca6a103d77864aa3b564ca197458b2cd1-gif.gif\" alt=\"边缘植被预览（淡入淡出效果）\"></p><p><em>（<a href=\"./edgy-foliage/gallery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">画质抱歉 - 建议查看画廊！</a>）</em></p><h2>鸣谢</h2><p>最初灵感来源于 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252falkalinechaos%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">u/alkalinechaos</a> 及其在 Reddit 上的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fMinecraft%252fcomments%252f2mz9m4%252fcustom_grass_block_model_makes_grass_less_blocky%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始帖子</a>。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
